<title>SWITZERLAND: Suedelektra H1 profit declines.</title>
<headline>Suedelektra H1 profit declines.</headline>
<dateline>ZUG, Switzerland 1996-09-09</dateline>
<text>
<p>Six months ended June 30, 1996.</p>
<p>				(million U.S. dollars unless stated)</p>
<p> Group after-tax net income 19.5		vs 43.4</p>
<p> Operating income	     32.9		vs 23.8</p>
<p> Operating cash flow	  47.8		vs 31.9</p>
<p> Capital spending	     126.3	     vs 32.3</p>
<p> Turnover			 164.1	     vs 114.6</p>
<p>NOTE - Fll name is Suedelektra Holding AG. -- Zurich Editorial +41 1 631 7340</p>
</text>
